            Power BI, NCUA/CFPB documentation. Cut complaint response cycles 50%.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="role">
        <div class="role-header">
          <h3>Independent engineering -- campos.works</h3>
          <span class="dates">2025 -- Present</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Model evaluation</strong> -- paid adversarial eval design for
